            "sid": "1CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaharaim divorced two wives, Hushim and Baara. Later, when he lived in the country of Moab, he married Hodesh and had seven sons: Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malcam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.8+1CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.8",
              "1CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeuz, Sachia, and Mirmah. His sons all became heads of families.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
