          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beriah and Shema were heads of families that settled in the city of Aijalon and drove out the people who lived in the city of Gath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.13"
