            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeiel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text (and see 9.35)",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jeiel",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew does not have this name.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " founded the city of Gibeon and settled there. His wife was named Maacah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and his eldest son, Abdon. His other sons were Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation (and see 9.36)",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ner",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew does not have this name.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nadab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedor, Ahio, Zechariah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Mikloth, the father of Shimeah. Their descendants lived in Jerusalem near other families of their clan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ner was the father of Kish, and Kish was the father of King Saul. Saul had four sons: Jonathan, Malchishua, Abinadab, and Eshbaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Eshbaal",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": Called Ishbosheth in 2 Sam 2.8 and elsewhere in 2 Sam.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathan was the father of Meribbaal,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Meribbaal",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": Called Mephibosheth in 2 Sam 4.4 and elsewhere in 2 Sam.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " who was the father of Micah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Micah had four sons: Pithon, Melech, Tarea, and Ahaz. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaz was the father of Jehoaddah, who was the father of three sons: Alemeth, Azmaveth, and Zimri. Zimri was the father of Moza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moza the father of Binea, Binea of Raphah, Raphah of Eleasah, and Eleasah of Azel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azel had six sons: Azrikam, Bocheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, and Hanan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azel's brother Eshek had three sons: Ulam, Jeush, and Eliphelet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulam's sons were outstanding soldiers and archers. He had 150 sons and grandsons in all. All those named above were members of the tribe of Benjamin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
